{%- comment -%}
  OPTIONAL: adds "Sign in with your store account". The arcade already works without this file
  (players simply make an arcade-only name), so skip it if you don't need store logins.

  WHERE  Paste this block immediately BEFORE the arcade's <script> tag.
         It only works if the arcade is in a THEME file or a "Custom Liquid" section. If the HTML is
         pasted into Online Store > Pages > the page's content editor, Liquid does not run there.

  SECRET Replace PASTE-YOUR-SECRET-HERE with a long random string, and set the exact same string as
         SHOPIFY_SECRET in Render (Environment tab). Make one with:
             python -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
         IMPORTANT: your GitHub repo is public. Keep the placeholder in this file in GitHub and put the
         real secret only in Shopify and Render. Anyone who learns it can pose as any customer.

  Only the signature this produces is sent to visitors' browsers, never the secret.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  window.ARENA_LOGIN  = {{ routes.storefront_login_url | json }};
  window.ARENA_LOGOUT = {{ routes.account_logout_url | json }};
  {%- if customer %}
  window.ARENA_USER = {
    id:   {{ customer.id | append: '' | json }},
    name: {{ customer.first_name | default: 'Player' | json }},
    sig:  {{ customer.id | append: '' | hmac_sha256: 'PASTE-YOUR-SECRET-HERE' | json }}
  };
  {%- endif %}
</script>
